{"root":"thievesguild_pickpocket_1","nodes":{"thievesguild_pickpocket_1":{"m":"Hello there.","r":[["Who are you?","thievesguild_pickpocket_2",[]],["What is this place?","thievesguild_thief_2",[]]],"w":[]},"thievesguild_pickpocket_2":{"m":"My real name is unimportant. People mostly call me Quickfingers.","r":[["Why is that?","thievesguild_pickpocket_3",[]]],"w":[]},"thievesguild_pickpocket_3":{"m":"Well, I have a tendency to ... how shall I put this ... acquire certain things easily.","r":[["N","thievesguild_pickpocket_4",[]]],"w":[]},"thievesguild_pickpocket_4":{"m":"Things previously in the possession of other people.","r":[["Do you mean like stealing?","thievesguild_pickpocket_5",[["inventoryRemove","gold",1,0]]],["Isn't that stealing?","thievesguild_pickpocket_5",[["inventoryKeep","gold",1,1]]]],"w":[]},"thievesguild_pickpocket_5":{"m":"No no. I wouldn't call it stealing. It's more of a transfer of ownership. To me, that is.","r":[["That sounds a lot like stealing to me.","thievesguild_pickpocket_6",[]],["That sounds like a good justification.","thievesguild_pickpocket_6",[]]],"w":[]},"thievesguild_pickpocket_6":{"m":"After all, we are the Thieves' Guild. What did you expect?","r":[],"w":[]},"thievesguild_thief_2":{"m":"This is our guild hall. We are safe from the guards of Fallhaven in here.","r":[["N","thievesguild_thief_3",[]]],"w":[]},"thievesguild_thief_3":{"m":"We can do pretty much as we like here. As long as Umar allows it, that is.","r":[["Do you know where I can find Umar?","thievesguild_thief_4",[]],["Who is Umar?","thievesguild_thief_5",[]]],"w":[]},"thievesguild_thief_4":{"m":"He is probably in his room over there [points].","r":[["Thanks.","X",[]]],"w":[]},"thievesguild_thief_5":{"m":"Umar is our guild leader. He decides our rules and guides us in moral decisions.","r":[["Where can I find him?","thievesguild_thief_4",[]]],"w":[]}},"q":{},"i":{},"mo":{},"f":{},"sk":{"weaponChance":"Weapon Accuracy","weaponDmg":"Hard Hit","barter":"Merchant","dodge":"